  "description": "Embrace the spirit of autumn with the unique Rustic Fall Digital Papers Set. Included in this set are 10  autumn pattern designs/digital papers in vibrant fall hues. The digital papers showcase a charming array of autumn icons; from crisp foliage and whimsical leaves to ripe pumpkins and a host of captivating autumnal motifs. They are the ultimate accessory to infuse your projects with an irresistible touch of fall enchantment. Whether you’re crafting greeting or invitation cards, designing fashion, fabric, or textile pieces, creating digital backgrounds, engaging in scrapbooking, wrapping gifts, formulating printed designs, or indulging in paper crafts plus many more, these designs will add a flair that is quintessentially autumn. This package delivers 10 pattern designs in JPEG format with a dimension size of 3600 x 3600 px and high resolution of 300 DPI.\nYou’ll get …\n10 Pattern Designs\nFormat: JPEG\nDimensions: 3600 x 3600 px\nHigh Resolution: 300 DPI",
